meta {
  name: Alerts
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  In-app alert inbox for the authenticated user. The folder is state-changing: "Mark all my alerts as read" flips the seeded unread alerts of the recipient to read. Re-run the demo seed to restore them. The cross-user requests log in as a second user to prove that foreign alerts respond the same 404 as unknown ones.
}
